===Adjective===
{{en-adj|naughtier|naughtiest}}

# [[bad|Bad]]; tending to [[misbehave]] or act badly.
#: ''That '''naughty''' dog dug up Mrs. Duffy's petunias.''
# [[risque|Risque]]: [[sex|Sexually]] suggestive, usually in a mild way.

====Usage notes====
* Objects: dog, child, etc.

